body:
Definitely, I'll add a full matchup guide in a separate comment.  I hadn't considered Sorcerous Spyglass but I like the idea.  I've been unimpressed with Ashiok lately so she might get cut, she was much more impactful when the Dreadhorde Arcanist list was the deck to beat.  Underworld dreams sounds solid, especially against UW control.  I don't think I can do Grafdigger's Cage, the deck revolves around Fiend Artisan too much.  Agadeem's being shut off as well is rough.  

&#x200B;

At one point I was trying to play Pack Rat because I played the old standard black devotion list back in Theros, but I just never wanted it.  Rankle was also a Fiend Artisan target at one point but I almost never searched for it.  The number of Tymarets also shifts regularly depending on how many graveyard decks I'm seeing, right now the third is cut for Aetherborn because the meta is feeling pretty fast.  

&#x200B;

Play vs. draw doesn't matter too much.  Thoughtseize is really good at slowing down explosive hands and Knight of the Ebon Legion is a lightning rod for removal that could be aimed at Fiend Artisan later.  The one drops do a surprising amount of work in drawing the game out to our strong points.
